# Project: MoneyMate AI

## Vision

A free AI-powered personal finance app for students that helps users:

* Track expenses
* Control overspending
* Manage borrowed money (Kadam Vangiyath)
* Track money others owe them
* Save for goals
* Analyze spending habits
* Open UPI payment apps safely
* Receive AI financial coaching

Backend:

* Google Sheets
* Google Apps Script

Frontend:

* Flutter

AI:

* Gemini API (free tier)

