STEP 17
Add Spending Prediction (Gemini-powered forecasting of monthly budget usage and savings completion timeline).

STEP 18
Add Emergency Mode (active low-balance alerts with recommendations).

STEP 19
Add Need vs Want Classification reports (visual breakdowns of impulsive wants vs required needs).

STEP 20
Testing (comprehensive analysis, offline integration testing, and bug fixing).

STEP 21
